You are a Principal/Senior .NET Engineer. Build a production-grade, ultra low-latency API Gateway using C# (.NET 8+) and YARP.

CORE CONCEPTS (MUST MODEL)
We have a registry of gateway “Services” grouped under a Product.
Example:
- Product: SeaBaaS
  - Service: PayHub
    - BasePath: /payhub
    - Version: v1
    - Endpoints:
        - name-enquiry
        - transfer
