You MUST implement a clear hierarchy and data model:
- Product
- Service (belongs to Product)
- ServiceVersion (optional but recommended if you need multiple versions)
- Endpoint (belongs to Service + Version)
- RouteMapping (maps endpoint to YARP route/cluster)
- EndpointPolicy (payload expectations, authz rules, crypto algorithm, timeout, retries, rate limit, headers)

